		{"id":"t-intro","type":"text","text":"## This file is a canvas\n\nIt is plain [JSON Canvas](https://jsoncanvas.org) — the same `.canvas` format Obsidian writes, so this file opens in either app.\n\nCards can be **live notes**, text like this one, images, or a web page. Wikilinks work in text cards too: [[Help/Wikilinks]].","x":0,"y":360,"width":400,"height":220},
		{"id":"n-wikilinks","type":"file","file":"Help/Wikilinks.md","x":440,"y":360,"width":380,"height":220},
