		{"id":"t-design","type":"text","text":"### How this is built\n\nNodes are DOM inside a transformed layer; edges are one SVG overlay. See [[Meta/Analysis/Canvas]] for the design record, including why references are contained to the kiln that owns the canvas.","x":420,"y":640,"width":420,"height":180,"color":"6"}
